---
import '../styles/jackfrost.css';
import SMT5JackFrost from '../assets/jackFrost/JackFrostSMT5Model.png';
import MT2JackFrost from '../assets/jackFrost/JackFrostMT2.png';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Hee-Ho!</title>
	</head>
	<body>
	<header>
	    <h1>𝕵𝖆𝖈𝖐 𝕱𝖗𝖔𝖘𝖙 </h1>
	</header>
	<div class='container'>
	    <Image src = {SMT5JackFrost} alt = 'Jack Frosts SMT5 model' width=250 height=250 class = "smt5jf"/>
		<blockquote>"This time of Year being Cold and Frosty generally speaking, or when Jack-Frost commonly takes us by the Nose."</blockquote>
		<p> -Round about our Coal Fire: or Christmas Entertainments, 1732</p>
		<p>Born as a spirit to justify the pinch in ones cheek in the winter, Jack Frost has been in Anglo-Saxon folk lore since at least 1732 although likely for much longer.
		</p>
		<p>Jack Frost's origins described him as a man, completely different than the adorable spire you see above. It wasn't until the late 19th centure that a sprite like shape
		began to form around him and patterns in frozen windows gained meaning.</p>

		<p>He has appeared in many a media, often in stories revoling around Christmas, as a trickster in the winter. Sometimes associated with fall leaves, often a reason for all 
		negative factors of winter.</p>
		<Image src = {MT2JackFrost} alt = 'Jack Frosts SMT5 model' width=250 height=250 class = "smt5jf"/>

		
		
	</div>
	</body>
</html>
<style>
body{
    background-image: url(../assets/jackFrost/jfBackground.png);
    background-size: repeat;
}

div.container {

	border-radius: 5px;
	border: solid;
	border-color:rgba(82, 80, 85);
	border-width: 2px;
	margin:auto;
	margin-top: 0;
	padding: 1%;
	width: 50%;
    color:#cbced5;
	justify-content: center;
	background-color:rgba(25, 29, 188);
}

.smt5jf{
    float:right;
    position:relative;
    
}
header{
    margin:auto;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    height: 6.5em;
}

h1{
    /*padding: 150px 20px;*/
    font-size: 72px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-shadow:
            -2px -2px 0 #000,
            2px -2px 0 #000,
            -2px 2px 0 #000,
            2px 2px 0 #000,
            -3px 0px 0 #000,
            3px 0px 0 #000,
            0px -3px 0 #000,
            0px 3px 0 #000;
}
</style>
